  "worked_solution": "First, notice that\n\n$$\nb=i-j-k=\u27e81,-1,-1\u27e9.\n$$\n\nTo compute $a-2b,$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a-2b & =\u27e80,0,0\u27e9-2\\cdot \u27e81,-1,-1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e80,0,0\u27e9-\u27e82\\cdot 1,2\\cdot (-1),2\\cdot (-1)\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e80,0,0\u27e9-\u27e82,-2,-2\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-2,2,2\u27e9 \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
